# Restatement ledger (docs/standards/architecture.md rule 9) for the claim that the role
# ARN is a repository secret rather than a variable, so Actions masks the ARN and the
# account id in it in every run log. Owned by convention 7 of infra/README.md, which
# also names the mask and the check that holds it (.claude/scripts/check-oidc-workflows.sh
# rule 4).
#
# Membership is the name itself: every file that mentions the secret restates where it
# lives, and the sweep is its name.
owner: infra/README.md
claim: AWS_OIDC_ROLE_ARN is a repository secret, not a variable, so Actions masks the role ARN and the account id in it in every run log
sweep: AWS_OIDC_ROLE_ARN
scope: :!docs/tech-debt.md :!docs/friction-log.md :!docs/review-feedback.md
carrier: .claude/scripts/check-oidc-workflows.test.sh
carrier: .github/workflows/deploy-api.yml
carrier: .github/workflows/deploy-forecast.yml
carrier: .github/workflows/deploy-ingestion.yml
carrier: .github/workflows/deploy-web.yml
carrier: .github/workflows/oidc-smoke.yml
carrier: infra/bootstrap/outputs.tf
